flowchart LR 
    U[Schwab User] 
    SSO[SAML / MySSO] 
    XAPI[Cloud Journey XAPI / Backend] 
    AUTHZ[Ingress Authorization<br/>Custom Authorizer] 
    APM[APM Role / Access API] 
    AGENT[Cloud Journey Agent<br/>Vertex AI Agent Engine] 
    GW[Agent Gateway] 
    SP[Semantic Policy<br/>Action / Data Guardrails] 
    GMCP[Google Managed MCP Server] 
    CMCP[Custom MCP Server<br/>Cloud Run] 
    GCP[GCP Services] 
    ENT[Schwab / Enterprise APIs] 
    
    U -->|Authenticate| SSO 
    SSO -->|Authenticated User Context| XAPI 
    XAPI --> AUTHZ 
    AUTHZ -->|Resolve User + APM| APM 
    APM -->|Role / Scope / Permissions| AUTHZ 
    AUTHZ -->|Authorized Request + User Context| AGENT 
    AGENT -->|Agent Identity + Protected User Context| GW 
    GW --> SP 
    SP --> GMCP 
    SP --> CMCP 
    GMCP --> GCP 
    CMCP --> ENT